{"page":559,"width":1924,"height":2547,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"14.8 해싱의 응용 분야","words":[{"text":"14.8","x":393,"y":205,"width":84,"height":50},{"text":"해싱의","x":491,"y":203,"width":143,"height":55},{"text":"응용","x":651,"y":205,"width":96,"height":55},{"text":"분야","x":762,"y":207,"width":96,"height":54}]},{"text":"해싱은 방대한 양의 데이터에 액세스해아히는 상황에서 널리 시용된다. 해성을 사용하면 신속하","words":[{"text":"해싱은","x":392,"y":353,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"방대한","x":496,"y":355,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"양의","x":599,"y":355,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"데이터에","x":671,"y":355,"width":116,"height":36},{"text":"액세스해아히는","x":802,"y":358,"width":209,"height":36},{"text":"상황에서","x":1022,"y":360,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"널리","x":1155,"y":361,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"시용된다.","x":1225,"y":361,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"해성을","x":1368,"y":363,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"사용하면","x":1470,"y":363,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"신속하","x":1604,"y":363,"width":89,"height":36}]},{"text":"게 정보를 검색할 수 있다. 해싱이 시용되는 몇 가지 전형적인 예는 다음과 같다.","words":[{"text":"게","x":392,"y":411,"width":27,"height":35},{"text":"정보를","x":435,"y":412,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"검색할","x":538,"y":414,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":637,"y":415,"width":32,"height":33},{"text":"있다.","x":680,"y":414,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"해싱이","x":760,"y":414,"width":86,"height":37},{"text":"시용되는","x":860,"y":417,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"몇","x":990,"y":416,"width":26,"height":36},{"text":"가지","x":1030,"y":418,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"전형적인","x":1102,"y":418,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"예는","x":1231,"y":420,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"다음과","x":1300,"y":421,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"같다.","x":1402,"y":423,"width":67,"height":34}]},{"text":"• 해성은 데이터베이스 인데싱에 시용된다. 일부 데이터베이스 관리 시스템은 별도의 인덱스 파","words":[{"text":"•","x":402,"y":511,"width":9,"height":10},{"text":"해성은","x":430,"y":499,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"데이터베이스","x":534,"y":501,"width":181,"height":35},{"text":"인데싱에","x":727,"y":501,"width":116,"height":37},{"text":"시용된다.","x":856,"y":504,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"일부","x":998,"y":504,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"데이터베이스","x":1067,"y":505,"width":178,"height":36},{"text":"관리","x":1256,"y":506,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"시스템은","x":1327,"y":507,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"별도의","x":1460,"y":511,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"인덱스","x":1562,"y":510,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"파","x":1661,"y":512,"width":30,"height":33}]},{"text":"일을 사용한다. 데이터가 파일에서 추출되어야 할 때, 탐색기는 먼저 인덱스 파일에서 김색되","words":[{"text":"일을","x":432,"y":557,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"사용한다.","x":504,"y":558,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"데이터가","x":648,"y":560,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"파일에서","x":778,"y":560,"width":117,"height":37},{"text":"추출되어야","x":909,"y":563,"width":151,"height":36},{"text":"할","x":1070,"y":564,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"때,","x":1112,"y":564,"width":36,"height":36},{"text":"탐색기는","x":1163,"y":565,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"먼저","x":1296,"y":566,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"인덱스","x":1367,"y":567,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"파일에서","x":1468,"y":569,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"김색되","x":1603,"y":569,"width":84,"height":35}]},{"text":"고, 검색 결과로부터 데이터베이스 파일에서의 정확한 위치를 알 수 있다. 인덱스 파일의 기","words":[{"text":"고,","x":430,"y":620,"width":38,"height":32},{"text":"검색","x":488,"y":617,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"결과로부터","x":562,"y":617,"width":146,"height":37},{"text":"데이터베이스","x":725,"y":619,"width":179,"height":36},{"text":"파일에서의","x":916,"y":621,"width":147,"height":37},{"text":"정확한","x":1080,"y":624,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"위치를","x":1182,"y":624,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"알","x":1284,"y":625,"width":30,"height":33},{"text":"수","x":1326,"y":625,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":1371,"y":626,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"인덱스","x":1456,"y":628,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"파일의","x":1557,"y":628,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"기","x":1662,"y":629,"width":24,"height":33}]},{"text":"정보는 종종 해시 테이블로 구현된다.","words":[{"text":"정보는","x":432,"y":675,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"종종","x":533,"y":678,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"해시","x":606,"y":677,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"테이블로","x":677,"y":678,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"구현된다.","x":806,"y":679,"width":126,"height":35}]},{"text":"• 해성 기술은 컴파일러에서 심볼 테이블을 구현하는 데 시용된다. 컴파일러는 소스 프로그램에","words":[{"text":"•","x":403,"y":745,"width":9,"height":9},{"text":"해성","x":432,"y":733,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"기술은","x":505,"y":734,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"컴파일러에서","x":608,"y":736,"width":175,"height":37},{"text":"심볼","x":798,"y":738,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"테이블을","x":868,"y":738,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"구현하는","x":996,"y":740,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"데","x":1127,"y":741,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"시용된다.","x":1166,"y":741,"width":126,"height":35},{"text":"컴파일러는","x":1309,"y":742,"width":149,"height":34},{"text":"소스","x":1468,"y":745,"width":60,"height":27},{"text":"프로그램에","x":1539,"y":745,"width":148,"height":35}]},{"text":"서 A卜우자가 정의한 모든 식별자(심볼)의 기록을 유지하기 위하여 심볼 테이블을 시용한다. 심","words":[{"text":"서","x":432,"y":792,"width":27,"height":34},{"text":"A卜우자가","x":473,"y":792,"width":124,"height":37},{"text":"정의한","x":608,"y":794,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"모든","x":707,"y":799,"width":61,"height":31},{"text":"식별자(심볼)의","x":779,"y":797,"width":195,"height":35},{"text":"기록을","x":989,"y":798,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"유지하기","x":1086,"y":799,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"위하여","x":1218,"y":800,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"심볼","x":1317,"y":801,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"테이블을","x":1388,"y":801,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"시용한다.","x":1517,"y":802,"width":128,"height":34},{"text":"심","x":1660,"y":804,"width":26,"height":33}]},{"text":"볼 테이블에서는 해싱을 사용하여 변수의 이름이나 함수의 이름을 빠르게 찾을 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"볼","x":432,"y":851,"width":32,"height":33},{"text":"테이블에서는","x":474,"y":851,"width":184,"height":37},{"text":"해싱을","x":668,"y":855,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"사용하여","x":768,"y":856,"width":116,"height":34},{"text":"변수의","x":899,"y":856,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"이름이나","x":999,"y":857,"width":117,"height":34},{"text":"함수의","x":1126,"y":857,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"이름을","x":1228,"y":859,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"빠르게","x":1326,"y":859,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"찾을","x":1427,"y":860,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"수","x":1496,"y":860,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":1540,"y":860,"width":64,"height":34}]},{"text":"• 해성은 인터넷 검색 엔진에서 널리 시용된다.","words":[{"text":"•","x":405,"y":921,"width":10,"height":10},{"text":"해성은","x":433,"y":910,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"인터넷","x":538,"y":911,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"검색","x":639,"y":913,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"엔진에서","x":709,"y":913,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"널리","x":839,"y":914,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"시용된다.","x":908,"y":914,"width":126,"height":36}]},{"text":"568 C언어로 쉽게 불어쓴 자료구조","words":[{"text":"568","x":126,"y":2391,"width":57,"height":29},{"text":"C언어로","x":210,"y":2394,"width":82,"height":25},{"text":"쉽게","x":300,"y":2394,"width":43,"height":26},{"text":"불어쓴","x":352,"y":2395,"width":67,"height":25},{"text":"자료구조","x":427,"y":2395,"width":91,"height":24}]}]}